# Hand edits are backed up next to the real file. Backups are not source of
# truth and must never be loaded, so they stay out of the tree.
*.prompt-backup
*.bak
~

# `bundle/` is the migrated preset bundle, but its cordis.patch.yml must name
# the package modules with absolute file:// URLs: `name` is a literal and
# `!!js` expressions only evaluate inside `config`. The URLs therefore embed
# this machine's $DSH_HOME (/home/lumin/...), so the file is unusable and
# non-portable for anyone else. Regenerate it on the target machine against
# its own install path instead of copying this directory.
bundle/
